English: New American Standard Bible (NASB 1995)\\[0.8em]

\textbf{主要參考資料 / Primary Sources}\\
\textbullet\ 老弟兄查經方法論與領受框架之應用（本書無對應之老弟兄加拉太書逐節查經筆記原始記錄；詳見附錄二誠實說明）\\
\textbullet\ John MacArthur - Galatians sermon series (gty.org)\\
\textbullet\ G. Campbell Morgan, \textit{Living Messages of the Books of the Bible}\\
\textbullet\ Martin Luther, \textit{A Commentary on St. Paul's Epistle to the Galatians}\\
\textbullet\ John Calvin, \textit{Commentary on Galatians and Ephesians}\\
\textbullet\ John Chrysostom, \textit{Commentary on Galatians} (NPNF1-13)\\[0.8em]

\textbf{核心主題 / Central Theme}\\
保羅寫給加拉太教會最急迫的一封信——為要挽回一群正被「別的福音」引誘離開恩典的信徒，重申只有一個福音：人稱義不是靠行律法，乃是靠信耶穌基督；這稱義的信心，帶進聖靈所賜、活在基督裏的真自由。\\
Paul's most urgent letter — written to recall a church being lured from grace by "a different gospel," reasserting that there is only one gospel: a person is justified not by works of the Law but through faith in Jesus Christ — and that this justifying faith opens into the true freedom of life in the Spirit.\\[0.8em]

本書為三書精讀項目成果之一。\\
Part of the Three Books Deep Reading Project.
