本書逐章研讀加拉太書全書六章，並附索引與參考資料附錄，整合老弟兄一貫的查經方法論與以基督為中心的領受框架（本書並無對應之老弟兄加拉太書逐節查經筆記原始記錄，此為誠實說明，詳見附錄），alongside John MacArthur 逐節解經講道系列、G. Campbell Morgan、馬丁·路德的《加拉太書講義》，以及加爾文的注釋。全信的軌跡，從保羅為使徒職分與福音真理申辯、到因信稱義而非因行律法的教義根基、到應許先於律法四百三十年的啟示次序、到時候滿足時神兒子的降生、到聖靈所賜兒子的名分、直到在聖靈中結出果子的真自由——保羅寫給加拉太教會最急迫的一封信，在這裡逐章展開。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} chapter-by-chapter study of all six chapters of Galatians, with index and references appendices, integrating the Elder's documented Bible-study methodology and Christ-centered theological framework (this book has no corresponding verse-by-verse Elder teaching notes on Galatians itself — an honest disclosure detailed in the appendix), alongside John MacArthur's verse-by-verse sermon series, G. Campbell Morgan, Martin Luther's Commentary on Galatians, and John Calvin. The letter's arc unfolds chapter by chapter: Paul's defense of his apostleship and the truth of the gospel, the doctrinal foundation of justification by faith apart from works of the Law, the revelation-order argument that the promise preceded the Law by four hundred thirty years, the Son's birth in the fullness of time, the Spirit-given adoption as sons, and the true freedom that bears fruit in the Spirit — Paul's most urgent letter, traced here in full.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

